OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son, 15, stable after
OL,4,Amasked men attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have confirmed a father and his
OL,7,F15-year-old son, who were stabbed in
OL,8,Ftheir home by masked intruders in what
OL,9,Fwas described as a "completely
OL,10,Funprovoked" attack, are now in a stable
OL,11,Fcondition.
OL,13,FImrane Chelirem, 15, and his father
OL,14,FMohamed were named locally as the
OL,15,Fvictims of the attack at the hands of
OL,16,Ftwo masked men in Station Road,
OL,17,FThurnby, Leicestershire, shortly before
OL,18,F00:30 BST on 8 October.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
