OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son, 15, stable after
OL,4,Amasked men attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FImrane was a "teammate, a friend and a
OL,7,Fhuge part of our football family,"
OL,8,FCoalville Town Raptors said in a social
OL,9,Fmedia post.
OL,11,FOn Wednesday, Leicestershire Police
OL,12,Fsaid the man, in his 50s, and the boy
OL,13,Fwere continuing to receive specialist
OL,14,Ftreatment in hospital.
